        "pageid": 78097158,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Arco (video game)",
        "extract": "Arco is a 2024 Western-themed turn‐based strategy RPG. It was made by an international team including Polish pixel artist Franek Nowotniak, Australian game developer Max Cahill, Spanish composer and sound designer José Ramón \"Bibiki\" García, and Mexican developer Antonio \"Fayer\" Uribe, and published by Panic Inc.⁠\nThe game was released on 15 August 2024 for Windows, Mac, and Nintendo Switch, and was praised by critics for its art style, combat system, story, and setting.",
